Description: Standalone COSMIC panel applet for per-output hardware and alpha dimming
 A COSMIC panel applet that dims each display on its own: in hardware over
 DDC/CI where the display supports it, and in software through a translucent
 overlay on any display. It installs beside the stock COSMIC applets and
 replaces none of them. A udev rule gives the i2c group access to the displays'
 DDC buses only; add yourself with `sudo usermod -aG i2c $USER`.

